    {
      "key": "t60efd03c9cc4163c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Are Common Misconceptions About Forex Liquidity?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">關於外匯流動性的常見誤解是什麼？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td715e9d0f0c83410",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Forex liquidity is often confused with several related but different concepts.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外匯流動性經常與幾個相關但不同的概念混淆。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tac2cbccb08637239",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A liquid pair can still move sharply when new information changes what buyers and sellers are willing to pay.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">當新資訊改變買家和賣家願意支付的價格時，流動性貨幣對仍可能大幅波動。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t861f893a942065b8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">High Liquidity Means Zero Slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">高流動性意味著零滑點</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tfb68ee60043c77a6",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">It does not.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">事實並非如此。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4ce64003ed0fe671",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Liquidity Is the Same All Day</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">全天流動性相同</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6b92fb9bcf709227",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is one reason session timing can matter when evaluating spreads and execution conditions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">這也是評估點差和成交條件時，交易時段的時間安排可能很重要的原因之一。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t789913e8786d5e52",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A tight spread can be associated with strong liquidity, but spread is only one indicator.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">較小的點差可能與較強的流動性相關，但點差只是一個指標。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t420d830d18217dd1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The published account conditions are:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity",
