    },
    {
      "key": "tf58ec93281736094",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Published Spread</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">公布的點差</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8bc167545356b75a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Minimum trade size of 0.01 lots</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">最小交易規模為0.01手</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tce2771c187ead2f5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The quoted spreads are starting levels rather than a promise that the minimum spread will be available on every order.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">報價的點差是起始水平，而不是每個訂單都可用的最低點差的承諾。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3a69c335c3d27cfb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What is liquidity in forex?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什麼是外匯流動性？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1b08adcc6174c416",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Liquidity in forex describes how easily a currency pair can be bought or sold using available market prices without a relatively small transaction causing a material price movement. Higher liquidity normally means more buying and selling interest is available near the current price, while lower liquidity means market depth is thinner.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外匯流動性描述了按市場可用價格買賣貨幣對的容易程度，即相對較小的交易不會造成顯著價格變動。流動性較高通常意味著當前價格附近有更多買賣意願，而流動性較低則意味著市場深度較薄。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td055319f05eef6b1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What are the most liquid forex pairs?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">流動性最強的外匯對是什麼？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta15dd384139e2b90",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How does liquidity affect forex spreads?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
